  "EventItemAgendaNumber": "2.8",
  "EventItemTitle": "Amendment to the Agreement with Universal Protection Security Systems, LP for Internet Protocol Television Support and Maintenance Services.",
  "EventItemActionName": null,
  "EventItemActionText": "Adopt a resolution authorizing the City Manager or her designee to: \r\n(a) Negotiate and execute an amendment to the Agreement for Internet Protocol Television Support and Maintenance Services with Universal Protection Security Systems, LP (Santa Ana, CA) to adjust the rates of compensation and add two additional one-year options to extend the Agreement through October 31, 2028, subject to the appropriation of funds; and\r\n(b) Exercise up to two additional one-year options to extend the term of the Agreement ending on or about October 31, 2028, subject to the appropriation of funds. \r\nCEQA: Not a Project, File No. PP17-003, Agreements/Contracts (New or Amended) resulting in no physical changes to the environment. (Airport/Finance)",
